BRANCH other -3*B - 2*sqrt(2)*B + 2*sqrt(2) + 4
COEFF 2 (80*sqrt(2) + 120)*(B**2 + B*(-18/5 + 8*sqrt(2)/5) - 17/5 + 12*sqrt(2)/5)
